@prefix : <http://www.semanticweb.org/patient_monitoring#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix fhir: <http://hl7.org/fhir/> .

<http://www.semanticweb.org/patient_monitoring> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports fhir: .

### Classes (32 класи)
:Patient a owl:Class .
:PatientFeedback a owl:Class .
:SymptomFeedback a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :PatientFeedback .
:ServiceFeedback a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :PatientFeedback .

:Symptom a owl:Class .
:PainSymptom a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Symptom .
:RespiratorySymptom a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Symptom .
:CardiovascularSymptom a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Symptom .

:VitalSign a owl:Class .
:HeartRate a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :VitalSign .
:BloodPressure a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :VitalSign .
:BodyTemperature a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :VitalSign .
:OxygenSaturation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :VitalSign .

:MedicalDevice a owl:Class .
:PulseOximeter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :MedicalDevice .
:WearableSensor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :MedicalDevice .

:Sentiment a owl:Class .
:PositiveSentiment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Sentiment .
:NegativeSentiment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Sentiment .
:NeutralSentiment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Sentiment .

:Action a owl:Class .
:AlertAction a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Action .
:MedicationAdjustment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Action .

:HealthcareProvider a owl:Class .
:Doctor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :HealthcareProvider .
:Nurse a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :HealthcareProvider .

:MedicalCondition a owl:Class .
:ChronicCondition a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :MedicalCondition .
:AcuteCondition a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :MedicalCondition .

:MonitoringSituation a owl:Class .
:Event a owl:Class .
:State a owl:Class .
:Sensor a owl:Class .

:Observation a owl:Class .
:DiagnosticReport a owl:Class .
:TreatmentPlan a owl:Class .
:Therapy a owl:Class .
:HospitalWard a owl:Class .

### Direct Disjointness (Пряма диз'юнктність)
:PositiveSentiment owl:disjointWith :NegativeSentiment .
:PositiveSentiment owl:disjointWith :NeutralSentiment .
:NegativeSentiment owl:disjointWith :NeutralSentiment .
:SymptomFeedback owl:disjointWith :ServiceFeedback .

### AllDisjointClasses Axioms
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
    owl:members ( :PositiveSentiment :NegativeSentiment :NeutralSentiment ) .

[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
    owl:members ( :SymptomFeedback :ServiceFeedback ) .

### Restrictions & Axioms
:Patient rdfs:subClassOf [
    a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty :hasFeedback ;
    owl:someValuesFrom :PatientFeedback
] .

:SymptomFeedback rdfs:subClassOf [
    a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty :mentionsSymptom ;
    owl:someValuesFrom :Symptom
] .

:PulseOximeter rdfs:subClassOf [
    a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty :measuresVitalSign ;
    owl:allValuesFrom :OxygenSaturation
] .

:PatientFeedback rdfs:subClassOf [
    a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty :submittedBy ;
    owl:qualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    owl:onClass :Patient
] .

:MedicalDevice rdfs:subClassOf [
    a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty :hasDeviceID ;
    owl:minCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
] .

### Object Properties (10 властивостей)
:hasFeedback a owl:ObjectProperty .
:submittedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    a owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf :hasFeedback .

:mentionsSymptom a owl:ObjectProperty .
:hasSentiment a owl:ObjectProperty ; a owl:FunctionalProperty .

:monitorsPatient a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf :isMonitoredBy .
:isMonitoredBy a owl:ObjectProperty .

:treatsPatient a owl:ObjectProperty .
:triggeredBy a owl:ObjectProperty .
:measuresVitalSign a owl:ObjectProperty .
:associatedWithSymptom a owl:ObjectProperty ; a owl:TransitiveProperty .
:hasSeverity a owl:ObjectProperty .

### Data Properties (5 властивостей)
:hasFeedbackText a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :PatientFeedback ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:hasTimestamp a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :PatientFeedback ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
:hasScore a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :Sentiment ; rdfs:range xsd:float .
:hasValueNumeric a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :VitalSign ; rdfs:range xsd:double .
:hasDeviceID a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :MedicalDevice ; rdfs:range xsd:string .